coi rodo
I have just created the 2nd edition of my jbovlaste-based dictionary (linked
below)

Some additions in this edition

   - updated database
   - analysis of lujvo (works almost every time)
   - hyperlinks from lujvo analysis and from links in the text
   - error list: lojban words that have rafsi, but no English word maps back
   to them
   - error list: words linked from lojban definitions, but that have no
   definitions of their own.

I would much appreciate comments, and especially translations of the English
text I have in the headers.

I would also like to encourage everyone to check out the error lists at the
end of the PDF file, and go to jbovlaste and fix it.

mi'e ioav


